  "description": "Bunifu UI is a market-leading suite of ready-made controls that help you build beautiful .NET Windows Forms applications faster. For more info, please visit https://bunifuframework.com/\n\nOnce installed, please visit https://docs2.bunifuframework.com/docs/getting-started/install for guidelines on how to install and activate Bunifu UI.",
